{"h":"rocky-mens-boot-rkw0467-w","t":"Rocky Men's Ironhawk Waterproof Western Boots (RKW0467 W - Brown)","b":"Rocky","c":"Boots","d":"Details \n The Rocky IronHawk is built for the tough, no-nonsense man who demands durability and strength. Crafted from waterproof full-grain leather and reinforced with triple-stitched rubber heel guard, this 12\" boot stands up to abrasions and harsh environments. The oil- and slip-resisting high-abrasion rubber outsole, paired with a lightweight EVA midsole, ensures stability on unpredictable terrain. Keep your feet dry and energized with guaranteed Rocky\u00ae Recycled Waterproof construction and our Rocky\u00ae Air-Port Lite\u00ae sponge PU footbed with memory foam. This boot meets ASTM F2892 electrical hazard standard for guaranteed protection on the job site.\n- Lightweight EVA Midsole\n- Oil- & Slip-Resisting High-Abrasion Rubber Outsole\n- Guaranteed Rocky\u00ae Recycled Waterproof Construction\n- 12 Inches in height\n- Flex Welt Construction\n- Triple-Stitched Rubber Heel Guard\n- Waterproof Full Grain Leather\n- Fancy Stitch Shaft\n- Expansion Fit Seam for easy on and off\n- Rocky\u00ae Air-Port Lite\u00ae Sponge PU Footbed with Memory Foam\n- Decorative Toe Bug\n- Square toe\n- ASTM F2892 electrical hazard standard","tags":["Men / Man / Hombre / Caballero"],"imgs":["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_profile_22635.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_singlequarter_22633.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_profileleft_22641.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_outsole_22642.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_doublequarter_22631.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/rocky_gunsmokewppullon_men_rkw0467_doubleheel_22